      "source": [
        "# Reef Fish Classifier v2: Metadata Fusion + Revised Augmentation\n",
        "\n",

        "- RQ4 (metadata fusion): the original collected lat/long and observation\n",
        "  date in the manifest but excluded them from every model. Does fusing them\n",
        "  with the image embedding improve species classification, and how much of\n",
        "  any gain is geography doing work the original never tested?\n",
        "- RQ5 (augmentation redo): the original's Arm B accuracy loss (targeted\n",
        "  augmentation hurt the low-data classes it targeted and spilled over into\n",
        "  untouched classes). Does a symmetric, realism-matched augmentation policy\n",
        "  (color-cast jitter, mild blur, occlusion -- applied to every class alike)\n",
        "  reverse that, as the report's own diagnosis predicts it should?\n",
        "\n",

