        "\n",
        "Three models sharing identical architecture (dense=256, dropout=0.4), optimizer,\n",
        "learning rate, and epoch budget, differing only in which branch(es) feed the\n",
        "head. That's what makes the three-way comparison fair: any difference in\n",
        "result is attributable to the input signal, not to an unrelated architecture\n",
        "change."
      ],
      "id": "83kOnon2DXzO"
    },
